 "intro_html": "The chicken version of <a href=\"bulgogi.html\">bulgogi</a>: whole boneless thighs marinated in <b>soy, pear, garlic and ginger</b>, browned in a steel pan, then glazed with the leftover marinade and sliced. It needs no thin slicing, just ordinary thigh fillets. Mild and sweet-savoury. This is a home adaptation built from several Korean sources and has not been kitchen tested.",
