 "notes": [
  {
   "html": "<p>Sliced dak bulgogi works in <a href=\"bibimbap.html\">bibimbap</a> instead of beef, or wrapped in lettuce with rice.</p>",
   "title_html": "For bibimbap or wraps"
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>For a spicy version (dak bulgogi is often made red), stir <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 tbsp</span> gochujang and <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 tsp</span> gochugaru into the marinade.</p>",
   "title_html": "A little heat"
  }
