 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Lay each thigh flat, smooth side down. Where the meat is thicker than about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"1.5\" data-s=\"0\">1.5 cm</span>, make 2–3 shallow cuts so it lies evenly and cooks at the same speed.</li><li>Mix the marinade, coat the chicken in it and leave for <b>30 minutes</b>, or up to a day in the fridge.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
