    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"600\">600 g</span> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"6\" data-b=\"7\" data-f=\"fillet|fillets\" data-n=\"3\">6–7 fillets</span>)",
     "name_html": "Boneless chicken thighs"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Add the onion around the chicken and pour in the saved marinade with <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"3\" data-s=\"0\">3 tbsp</span> water. Cover and cook on <b>medium</b> for <b>3 minutes</b>.</li><li>Uncover and turn the thighs in the bubbling sauce for <b>1–2 minutes</b> more, until it is thick and shiny and the chicken is cooked through (no pink at the thickest part).</li></ul>",
