  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Rest the thighs for 2 minutes, then cut them into <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"2\" data-s=\"0\">2 cm</span> strips. Spoon the glaze and onion over, and scatter with spring onion and sesame seeds. Serve with rice.</li></ul>",
